        "params": {
          "data": "{\"version\": 2, \"columns\": [{\"name\": \"Project\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"Region\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"Score\", \"type\": \"number\"}, {\"name\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"Region colour\", \"type\": \"text\"}], \"rows\": [[\"Atlas\", \"North\", 88, \"green\", \"#2563eb\"], [\"Beacon\", \"North\", 52, \"amber\", \"#2563eb\"], [\"Cobalt\", \"North\", 31, \"red\", \"#2563eb\"], [\"Delta\", \"South\", 76, \"green\", \"#db2777\"], [\"Ember\", \"South\", 44, \"red\", \"#db2777\"], [\"Falcon\", \"South\", 61, \"amber\", \"#db2777\"], [\"Granite\", \"East\", 93, \"green\", \"#0d9488\"], [\"Harbor\", \"East\", 58, \"amber\", \"#0d9488\"], [\"Iris\", \"East\", 81, \"green\", \"#0d9488\"], [\"Juniper\", \"West\", 27, \"red\", \"#7c3aed\"], [\"Kestrel\", \"West\", 66, \"amber\", \"#7c3aed\"], [\"Lumen\", \"West\", 84, \"green\", \"#7c3aed\"]]}",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 380
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": "Projects"
      },
      {
        "id": "pc_note",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          0,
          500
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "## Choose each category's colour\n\nEvery chart here is in **More options**.\n\n**1 \u00b7 Status in RAG colours** \u2014 *Color from column* = `Status`. The column holds `red`, `amber`, `green`, so the bars are those colours. Color by is empty, so the chart is coloured by Status itself.\n\n**2 \u00b7 Regions in brand colours** \u2014 *Color by* = `Region`, *Color from column* = `Region colour`, a column of `#hex` codes.\n\n**3 \u00b7 Named in JSON** \u2014 *Color map (JSON)*: `{\"green\": \"#16a34a\", \"amber\": \"orange\", \"red\": \"crimson\"}`. Wins over a column where both name a category.\n\n**4 \u00b7 Chart per Value** takes the same settings: one chart per region, still in RAG colours.\n\nA colour can be red, amber, green, orange, yellow, blue, purple, pink, brown, grey, black, white, any CSS name, `#hex` or `rgb()`.",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 300
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null
      },
      {
        "id": "pc_rag",
        "type": "flograph.viz.show_plotly",
        "pos": [
          800,
          0
        ],
        "params": {
          "kind": "bar",
          "x": "Project",
          "y": "Score",
          "more": true,
          "color_map_column": "Status",
          "title": "Project score, coloured by status",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 360
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": "1 \u00b7 Status in RAG colours"
      },
      {
        "id": "pc_brand",
        "type": "flograph.viz.show_plotly",
        "pos": [
          800,
          520
        ],
        "params": {
          "kind": "bar",
          "x": "Region",
          "y": "Score",
          "summarise": "average",
          "color": "Region",
          "more": true,
          "color_map_column": "Region colour",
          "title": "Average score by region",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 360
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": "2 \u00b7 Regions in brand colours"
      },
      {
